The Staff try to complete the burger, while the hidden Spy secretly sabotages it. Each game takes about 10 minutes. The free demo is available now, and the full game is coming soon. Add it to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:28:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1845383656379530","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"September 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates from September: Each language now has its own title English, Chinese and Korean translations are now in place Fall replays in the cooking history now show exactly what happened in the match You can now let everyone in the lobby know you'd like to play or spectate Each language now has its own title {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/f4d0444d5f52270ab3ae20e70490294caf76a0af.jpg The game now has its own title in each language. For every one of them, we picked a name that gets across ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T02:30:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1842212951308278","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"August 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates from August: Challenge runs are now recorded, and you can go for a high score Traditional Chinese and Korean have been added The settings screen has been rebuilt, and you can now choose your region Credits have been added The item Catalog can now be opened during a match Challenge runs are now recorded, and you can go for a high score {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/f44edc180691c43f7261f41e6abcc5a8b9b6b80e.png Your runs in the single-player Challenge mode are now recorded. Each ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T18:41:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1839676055885768","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"July 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates from July: The game can now be played with a keyboard or gamepad You can now watch a match as a spectator You can now rejoin a match after losing connection Achievements are now supported The game can now be played with a keyboard or gamepad {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/248c541e17d42058866530738812b1ab6dcd85d8.png Every screen — from the title screen through cooking, voting and results — can now be navigated with a keyboard or a gamepad. The keys available at any moment are s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T16:15:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1836506165562493","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"June 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates from June: Furigana (reading aids) have been added to Story Mode Rebalanced the items that appear in shops during the Shop Phase Acrobats now trigger automatically, and we added an option to use them manually Security improvements Furigana added to Story Mode {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/c9831b75a8cb80bb6f24f861ff0ab74cc7b4c5de.jpg Furigana (phonetic reading aids for kanji) have been added to the text in Story Mode. The Jinro Burger story is meant to be content that lets anyo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T13:27:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1835871199305931","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.17","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 17 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T02:17:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1833968530896178","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"May 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates for May. New ingredients and spices have been added The history page has been improved Quick Match is now available New Ingredients and Spices Added! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/d4306d41d29f6324169ac799c0b52ec33c5bfdb2.jpg We’ve added new ingredients, including pizzas and pineapples that explode upon impact, and ice cream scoops that connect as you stack them. The existing ingredients now serve as the \"Base Set,\" and you can now play by adding these new items as expansion pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T00:27:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896178","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1833968530892750","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.16","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 16 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T02:59:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1831432155570165","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"March 2026 Update","summary":"The following updates were implemented in April: Story Mode is now playable from start to finish. The UI for placing ingredients has been improved. New BGM has been added. Story Mode is Now Playable From Start to Finish {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/adac0b05b3285aad4fa408527d437e71032eb57e.jpg You can now play through the conversation segments along with the cooking segments that take place before and after them. This allows you to learn the game mechanics while following the story of the protagon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T02:43:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155570165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1831432155563912","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.15","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 15 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T02:30:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155563912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1829528821305565","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.14","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 14 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T02:59:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821305565","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1828441623112450","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"update","title":"March 2026 Update","summary":"Here are the updates for March: Spies can now select a \"Cheat\" at the start of the game. Ingredients can now be placed with greater precision. Players can now use emotes to indicate their intended destination or voting choice. The global pixel font has been updated to improve overall text readability. 😎 New Feature: Cheats Added {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45764409/d483870455631e30cc0f15a7fc7999f2aeb263a7.jpg We have introduced \"Passives\" for Spies that can be selected at the beginning of each match. Sin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T14:56:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623112450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1827626365767165","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.13","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 13 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T02:59:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365767165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-1825727806719058","game_id":"steam-3975350","kind":"announcement","title":"Staff Radio vol.12","summary":"Jinro Burger Radio Vol. 12 is out now! 📻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-03T02:39:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806719058","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3975350-18257278067126